        "id": 1123814
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-02-16T15:03:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So Rohm confirmed that the register limit and actual limit are both 1984 and the 1024 limit in the data sheet is an error. I think the charger limitation is inherent in the register limitation and I\u0027m not sure there is any additional utility in adding a #define that is used as an additional MIN check.",
